# kaneo_team

Manages a workspace-scoped team by native ID. Renames happen in place; changing `workspace_id` replaces the team. This resource does not manage team memberships.

The caller must belong to the workspace. Creation, updates, and deletion require `team.create`, `team.update`, and `team.delete` respectively. Listing, refresh, and import require workspace membership but not membership in the team. Instance admin access does not bypass workspace authorization.

